  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 56 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the dexamethasone sodium phosphate shortage on 2019-02-08 and it remains Current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E26", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage lists Eugia US LLC, Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., Mylan Institutional, and Somerset Therapeutics LLC as affected companies.",
      "cites": ["E21", "E22", "E23", "E24", "E25"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1074573 at Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited ended 2018-12-14 and was classified VAI, 56 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D10", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later inspection 1228546 at the same plant ended 2024-02-02 and was classified OAI, and inspection 1301166 ended 2026-02-06 also OAI.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA issued a Warning Letter to Eugia Pharma Specialities Limited on 2024-08-15.",
      "cites": ["E18"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 5.5 days of 1 mg tablets on hand and Corvale General has 25.9 days; the rule‑ranked option is to transfer 56 tablets from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would give Corvale East 14 days and leave Corvale General with 17 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check wholesalers for inventory as noted in FDA's related information for the Eugia US LLC listing.",
      "cites": ["E21"]
    }
  ]
}
